@PaymentRisk_HostAddress = https://localhost:7124

### 1. Check API & MySQL Health
GET {{PaymentRisk_HostAddress}}/health

###

### 2. Normal Approved Transfer (R5,000 -> Score 0, APPROVED)
POST {{PaymentRisk_HostAddress}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "ACC-1001",
  "toAccountNumber": "ACC-1002",
  "amount": 5000.00
}

