### 3. High-Value Risk Transfer (R60,000 -> Score 60, FLAGGED_REVIEW)
POST {{PaymentRisk_HostAddress}}/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "ACC-1001",
  "toAccountNumber": "ACC-1002",
  "amount": 60000.00
}
